      "content": "Stop rubbing your eye immediately, as friction will cause more damage and spread the caustic chemicals deeper into the tissue.\nInstead, flush your eye continuously with clean water or saline solution for at least 15 minutes while leaning over a sink to ensure the drain cleaner is completely washed away.\nYou should not use any herbal eye drops, as they contain unknown ingredients that could react dangerously with the chemical and worsen the burn.\nGo to the nearest emergency room or call 911 right now, as heavy-duty drain cleaners can cause permanent blindness if not treated with professional medical intervention immediately.",
